856
00:43:09.320 --> 00:43:13.000
We've got the boar
and two sows in here.

857
00:43:13.160 --> 00:43:14.760
But we started there

858
00:43:14.920 --> 00:43:17.560
and then we put him in
there with three sows.

859
00:43:17.680 --> 00:43:20.760
