put it in with the other lot?

863
00:43:29.560 --> 00:43:30.560
Yeah.

864
00:43:32.280 --> 00:43:33.280
What's wrong with that?

865
00:43:35.800 --> 00:43:37.680
No. you're joking?
You're kidding?

866
00:43:37.880 --> 00:43:39.960
